sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    %% Image Upload Sequence Diagram with AI Analysis
    %% Color Palette: color-palette-dark.css

    participant Customer
    participant API as API<br/>/customers/{id}/claims/{claim_id}/images
    participant Claim as Claim Service
    participant YOLO as YOLO Model<br/>(damage detection)
    participant VLM as Vision LLM<br/>(fraud pre-screening)
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Customer,DB: Image Upload Flow with AI Analysis

    %% Step 1: Customer uploads image
    Customer->>+API: POST image file

    %% Step 2: Verify claim is in 'draft' state
    API->>+Claim: Verify claim status
    Claim->>+DB: SELECT claim WHERE claim_id
    DB-->>-Claim: Claim record

    alt Claim NOT in 'draft' state
        Claim-->>API: Error: Invalid state
        API-->>Customer: 400 Bad Request<br/>Cannot add image<br/>(claim not in draft state)
    end

    Claim-->>-API: Claim status verified (draft)

    %% Step 3: Store image
    API->>DB: Store image file

    %% Step 4: Analyze image with YOLO (Damage Detection)
    API->>+YOLO: Analyze image for damage
    YOLO->>YOLO: YOLO inference<br/>(detect damages, bounding boxes)
    YOLO->>YOLO: Generate annotated image<br/>(BB-{filename})
    YOLO-->>-API: Damage detections<br/>(class, confidence, bbox, severity)

    %% Step 5: Add damage report to claim
    API->>+DB: INSERT INTO damages<br/>(YOLO detection + assessment data)
    DB-->>-API: Damage report(s) added

    %% Step 6: VLM Fraud Pre-Screening (Optional - during upload or submission)
    Note over API,VLM: Fraud analysis can occur during<br/>upload or deferred to submission

    opt Fraud Detection Enabled
        API->>+VLM: Analyze image for fraud signals
        VLM->>VLM: Check: vehicle color match
        VLM->>VLM: Check: vehicle make/model match
        VLM->>VLM: Check: AI-generated artifacts
        VLM->>VLM: Check: image manipulation signs
        VLM-->>-API: Fraud signals<br/>(color mismatch, make/model mismatch,<br/>AI-generated detection, etc.)

        API->>+DB: Store fraud analysis metadata
        DB-->>-API: Fraud signals stored
    end

    %% Step 7: Log event
    API->>+DB: INSERT INTO claims_events<br/>(action: image_uploaded)
    DB-->>-API: Event logged

    Note over API,DB: NO change in claim status<br/>(remains in 'draft')

    %% Step 8: Return success
    API-->>-Customer: 201 Created<br/>Image uploaded successfully

    Note over Customer,DB: ✓ Original image stored<br/>✓ Annotated image generated (BB- prefix)<br/>✓ YOLO damage detection complete<br/>✓ VLM fraud pre-screening (optional)<br/>✓ Damage report(s) added to DB<br/>✓ Event logged<br/>✗ NO status change (remains draft)
